d_3_x2c_30_x2c__x2d_14_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_3_x2c_38_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_3_x2c__x2d_48_x2c_3_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_3_x2c__x2d_54_x2c_2_x2e_> ;
