  pwglex:differentia "Root-fallback evidence_scope: the bare-root corpus candidates (двигаться/бродить/странствовать/совершать) are not forced onto this prefixed form; the German gloss «nachthun» ('подражать, поступать вслед за кем-л., делать по примеру') governs — an explanatory rendering rather than a single-word equivalent, since no one Russian verb captures 'act in imitation/following after' precisely."@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:machine-preview ;
  pwglex:model "claude-sonnet-5" ;
