  dct:references <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/AV_x2e__x2d_13_x2c_2_x2c_40_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/B_xe1__xb9__x9a_H_x2e__x2d__xc4__x80_R_x2e__x2d_UP_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_3_x2c_7_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/MBH_x2e__x2d_1_x2c_5515_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/MBH_x2e__x2d_3_x2c_1366_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/TAITT_x2e__x2d_UP_x2e__x2d_3_x2c_10_x2c_5_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/TBR_x2e__x2d_3_x2c_1_x2c_1_x2c_7_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_12_x2c_7_x2c_3_x2c_22_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_14_x2c_2_x2c_2_x2c_22_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_14_x2c_7_x2c_1_x2c_18_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_14_x2c_7_x2c_2_x2c_16_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_1_x2c_3_x2c_2_x2c_3_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_3_x2c_2_x2c_3_x2e_> ;
